    "previous_model_response": "In triangle \\(ABC\\),\n\n\\[\n\\angle BAC=180^\\circ-70^\\circ-30^\\circ=80^\\circ.\n\\]\n\nSince \\(\\triangle ABC\\cong\\triangle ADE\\), corresponding angles give\n\n\\[\n\\angle DAE=\\angle BAC=80^\\circ.\n\\]\n\nGiven \\(\\angle BAD=35^\\circ\\),\n\n\\[\n\\angle DAC=\\angle BAC-\\angle BAD=80^\\circ-35^\\circ=45^\\circ.\n\\]\n\nTherefore,\n\n\\[\n\\angle EAC=\\angle DAE-\\angle DAC=80^\\circ-45^\\circ=35^\\circ.\n\\]\n\nCorrect option: C. 35°"
  },
